  "inputs": [
   {
    "text": "I have read your note. I am not going to pretend I agree with it.",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "You say that if the statement had been taken that night, we would not be arguing about it now. But it was not taken that night, and we are here. What does the hypothetical buy us?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Even if you are right about the timing, it would not change what the witness says today. So why does it matter?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   }
  ],
