    "text": "Before you go on — when you say the jury decides, do you mean they decide guilt, or do they also decide the sentence?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Right. So in your system the defence is a public body, not a firm the family chooses. That changes what I was about to ask.",
